  "content": "<p>此修改調整了踩踏耕地機制，以保護耕地不被踩踏。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>功能包括</p>\n<ul>\n<li>「墜落減傷」附魔可防止耕地被踩踏。</li>\n<li>皮靴及其他具有tramplenomore:soft_boots物品標籤的物品可防止作物被踩踏。</li>\n<li>創造模式玩家無法踩踏作物。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>喜歡這個修改並想支持我嗎？</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/DarkhaxDev\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a>上關注我</li>\n<li>加入我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n<li>在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>上贊助我</li>\n<li>查看我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://nodecraft.com/assets/images/logo-dark.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"90\"></a><br>本項目由Nodecraft贊助。使用代碼&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Darkhax</a> 可在首月服務中享受30%折扣！<img src=\"https://skulk.blmj.red/trample-no-more\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>標誌由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=%253a%252f%252fgame-icons.net%252f1x1%252florc%252fboot-stomp.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lorc</a>於Game Icons製作，並授權採用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC By 3.0</a>。",
